{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026hUDddRLx7A1794470594.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>一名中國遊客在日本富士山失聯。</p><p></p><p>日本傳媒報道，失蹤的中國男子20多歲，周日上午獨自攀登已經封山的富士山，隨後失去聯絡，可能已經遇險。日本警方、消防等部門展開搜索，但未有發現。</p><p></p><p>中國駐日本大使館稱，該男子的家屬計劃前往日本搜尋，使館正提供積極協助。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T09:04:06.343810+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T06:24:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T14:57:28.889245+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T08:57:15.700004+00:00","content_hash":"d7f25c7231a996f2f9d5041a8111753bb482bdc8a9e1e81dedb87c37465cb17e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T09:04:06.343810+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}